# ============================================================
# Gothwad Tech — Cloudflare Pages redirects
# Canonical host: https://gothwadtech.com (apex, non-www).
#
# NOTE: Cloudflare Pages `_redirects` cannot redirect by domain/host —
# only by file path. www → apex must be a Redirect Rule in the
# Cloudflare zone (see README). Attempting it here silently does nothing.
# ============================================================

# 1) Legacy path aliases — keep old links alive
/about      /company   301
/portfolio  /ecosystem 301
/browser    /products  301
/leadership /company   301
/legacy     /ecosystem 301

# 2) No catch-all rewrite is needed: Cloudflare Pages already falls back to the
#    SPA shell for paths that do not match a static asset, and real files
#    (including the prerendered /ecosystem/index.html etc.) always win.
#    Do NOT add a top-level dist/404.html — that would disable the SPA fallback
#    and deep links would start returning 404 pages.
